 industry-relevant programs.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3752\" data-end=\"3873\"><strong data-start=\"3752\" data-end=\"3787\">Hybrid &amp; Remote Learning Models<\/strong><br data-start=\"3787\" data-end=\"3790\" \/>Support blended classrooms with wireless device integration and cloud management.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3877\" data-end=\"4012\"><strong data-start=\"3877\" data-end=\"3901\">Library &amp; Media Hubs<\/strong><br data-start=\"3901\" data-end=\"3904\" \/>Use as interactive kiosks or group learning stations with customizable interfaces and whiteboarding tools.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4016\" data-end=\"4173\"><strong data-start=\"4016\" data-end=\"4055\">Education Administration &amp; Planning<\/strong><br data-start=\"4055\" data-end=\"4058\" \/>Enhance staff meetings, teacher training, and digital planning sessions with 4K visuals and intuitive navigation.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1509\">Ultra HD 4K Display<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1509\">Android 9 OS<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1509\">20-point IR Touch<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1509\">Profile Management System<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1509\">Anti-glare Tempered Glass<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1509\">Whiteboard app<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1509\">Embedded WIFI and Bluetooth<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1509\">Wireless Screen Sharing<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":1120,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":""},"product_brand":[31],"product_cat":[39],"product_tag":[],"class_list":{"0":"post-1119","1":"product","2":"type-product","3":"status-publish","4":"has-post-thumbnail","6":"product_brand-vestel","7":"product_cat-interactive","9":"first","10":"instock","11":"shipping-taxable","12":"product-type-simple"},"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-j